{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026g2yIliKuxS1795413284.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產大埔昌運中心高級資深分區營業經理招權峰表示，大埔廣場最新錄5座中層C室，單位實用面積394平方呎，2房間隔，日前議價後以418萬元沽出，平均實用呎價約10,609元。</p><p><br/>據了解，新買家為同區客，見單位間隔合用，價錢合理，即決定購入單位自用。據了解，原業主於1984年以18萬元購入上址，持貨約42年，現轉手賬面獲利400萬元離場，單位期內升值22倍多。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T08:03:57.655323+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":179,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T07:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T18:57:34.777674+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T07:57:17.594288+00:00","content_hash":"dab980d08fc329e1b566d535a53bb4df38550a0440e6e5266caee49700d002ac","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T08:03:57.655323+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}